       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PRICING-AFTER.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  SAVE10-CODE PIC X(6) VALUE 'SAVE10'.
       01  VIP20-CODE PIC X(5) VALUE 'VIP20'.
       01  SAVE10-PERCENT PIC 99 VALUE 10.
       01  VIP20-PERCENT PIC 99 VALUE 20.
       01  PERCENT-BASE PIC 999 VALUE 100.
       01  PRICE-THRESHOLD PIC 9(4) VALUE 5000.
       01  PRICE-ADJUSTMENT PIC 999 VALUE 499.
       01  TOTAL-PRICE PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
       01  QUANTITY PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
       01  UNIT-PRICE PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
       01  DISCOUNT-CODE PIC X(8).
       01  CUSTOMER-ID PIC X(10).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT QUANTITY
           ACCEPT UNIT-PRICE
           ACCEPT DISCOUNT-CODE
           ACCEPT CUSTOMER-ID
           PERFORM CALCULATE-BASE-PRICE
           PERFORM APPLY-DISCOUNT
           PERFORM APPLY-PRICE-THRESHOLD
           DISPLAY TOTAL-PRICE
           GOBACK.

       CALCULATE-BASE-PRICE.
           COMPUTE TOTAL-PRICE = QUANTITY * UNIT-PRICE.

       APPLY-DISCOUNT.
           IF DISCOUNT-CODE = SAVE10-CODE
               COMPUTE TOTAL-PRICE = TOTAL-PRICE -
                   (TOTAL-PRICE * SAVE10-PERCENT / PERCENT-BASE)
           ELSE
               IF DISCOUNT-CODE = VIP20-CODE
                   IF CUSTOMER-ID(1:4) = 'VIP-'
                       COMPUTE TOTAL-PRICE = TOTAL-PRICE -
                           (TOTAL-PRICE * VIP20-PERCENT / PERCENT-BASE)
                   END-IF
               END-IF
           END-IF.

       APPLY-PRICE-THRESHOLD.
           IF TOTAL-PRICE < PRICE-THRESHOLD
               ADD PRICE-ADJUSTMENT TO TOTAL-PRICE
           END-IF.
